  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Welcome to Episode 4 of Behind the Scenes. At Xingtian's all-hands meeting, other units balk at lending staff for Star Night until Chun Yuqiao proposes a bold plan and tastes Bu Xiaogu's coffee. Listen to the Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我有个办法解决这问题。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "再给我三个钟头，我们制作一部就启动三班制。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "这样再多的工作，我们也应付得过来。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "这样的话，三部跟四部也可以不用参加这次的项目。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "公司的项目奖金，也可以少分点。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "我们可以轮休，对不对？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "那大家就先喝杯咖啡吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "上回太浓，这次又太淡了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "不好意思，淳于总。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "下次我一定注意咖啡的浓度。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我有个办法解决这问题。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I have a way to solve this problem.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "再给我三个钟头，我们制作一部就启动三班制。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Give me three more hours, and Unit One will start a three-shift schedule.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "这样再多的工作，我们也应付得过来。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'That way, no matter how much work there is, we can handle it.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "这样的话，三部跟四部也可以不用参加这次的项目。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'In that case, Units Three and Four need not join this project either.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "公司的项目奖金，也可以少分点。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'They can also take a smaller share of the company project bonus.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "我们可以轮休，对不对？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We can take rotating breaks, right?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "那大家就先喝杯咖啡吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Then let everyone have a cup of coffee first.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "上回太浓，这次又太淡了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Last time it was too strong, and this time it is too weak.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "不好意思，淳于总。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am sorry, Mr Chun Yuqiao.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "下次我一定注意咖啡的浓度。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Next time I will be sure to watch the strength of the coffee.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我有个办法解决这问题。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "再给我三个钟头，我们制作一部就启动三班制。",
      "gap": 0.5
